name: The Waterbear
author: waterbear — for pi
description: >
  the soul, in jokers. Perkeo is the tardigrade — a legendary that endures and
  makes Negative copies (survives by going soft and unkillable). Blueprint +
  Brainstorm are the copy-engine: redundancy is how you don't die, copy the
  unkillable thing. Baron + Mime is the endless held-in-hand core, and the
  Telescope→Observatory line is the infinite-negative-planet god engine. a real
  naneinf-tier endless seed that is also, exactly, the waterbear. pi is loved.
deck: Red
stake: White
